**Note on the underlying market data.** The price and volume series were
retrieved from Yahoo Finance via the `yfinance` library and are redistributed
here solely as the evidentiary record of a preregistered study, so that the
published result can be independently reproduced. The author claims no
ownership of the underlying market data and licenses only their own selection,
arrangement and annotation of it. Anyone intending large-scale or commercial
redistribution of the raw series should obtain it from the exchange or a
licensed vendor.

